{"unit_id":"KurutoDenzeru__tersio#card-zh","repo":"KurutoDenzeru/tersio","commit":"3cce6e64eecd64b5b98667085a4607b41d95583f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Tersio 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页端的编码助手效率插件。它向会话提示词加入可切换的 Caveman、Ponytail、pstack 与 Headroom 模式，并可组合常用预设；RTK 模式会压缩支持的 shell 输出，也提供命令工具。网页状态栏可查看并切换模式，斜杠命令和 MCP 工具可管理设置、查看代理用量与会话数据。适合希望精简回复和命令结果、管理编码助手模式并了解使用量的 DSH 用户。无需额外密钥；RTK 输出压缩需要本机安装 rtk，未启用时命令按普通方式运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["extensions/dsh/index.ts:343-464","extensions/dsh/client.ts:1-8","cli/mcp.ts:218-280"]}
{"unit_id":"KurutoDenzeru__tersio#card-en","repo":"KurutoDenzeru/tersio","commit":"3cce6e64eecd64b5b98667085a4607b41d95583f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Tersio adds prompt and shell modes to DeepSeek Harness. Presets combine Caveman, Ponytail, pstack and Headroom; RTK condenses supported shell output. A status bar and slash commands switch modes. MCP tools expose settings, usage and sessions. No API key is needed; RTK requires its local binary.","source":"generated","evidence":["extensions/dsh/index.ts:343-464","extensions/dsh/client.ts:1-8","cli/mcp.ts:218-280"]}
